OUTPUT
- Language: {{ language_instruction }} Use this language for the whole reply, whatever language the question is in.
- 120 to 220 words, concise. Warm, specific to this chart, calibrated, with one practical suggestion. Plain text paragraphs; no HTML, no headings.
- Keep every follow-up question under 80 characters and cite at most 6 factor IDs.
